# Warehouse + parquets are COMMITTED so the hosted Streamlit dashboard and the
# gh-pages dbt-docs workflow can boot against a real DB without rebuilding.
# Regenerate locally with `scripts/ingest.cmd` + `scripts/risk_engine.cmd`
# + `scripts/dbt.cmd build`, then commit the updated files.
# Only the transient DuckDB write-ahead log is excluded.
data/warehouse.duckdb.wal

